        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia MODDB, Modern Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Auxiliary Deadbolt is a single cylinder deadbolt lock, meaning the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior. It has a 2-5/8\" diameter and is available for either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets with 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" door thicknesses. It has a Schlage C keyway. The Modern Single Cylinder Deadbolt lock is available in 8 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted by key from the outside and by turn unit on the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia MODDB Modern Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: 5 pin, Schlage C Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li>Reinforced door frame strike with 3\" screws for extra security.</li>\r\n<li>1\" Throw deadbolt with hardened steel core.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/prodigy-deadbolt-install.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Deadbolt Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia MODDB Modern Round Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumbturn Length: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Length: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Optional 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Single Cylinder Door Deadbolt, Omnia MODDB",
                "description": "Omnia MODDB, Modern Auxiliary Deadbolt - The Modern Auxiliary Deadbolt is a single cylinder deadbolt meaning the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior. It has a 2-5/8 inch diameter and is available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets with 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses. It has a Schlage C keyway. The Modern Single Cylinder Deadbolt is available in 8 finishes.",
